                RowBox[{"fallback", " ", "to", " ", "sum", 
                 RowBox[{"(", 
                  RowBox[{"...", ",", "3"}], ")"}], " ", "when", " ", 
                 "appropriate"}], "*)"}], 
               RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"Length", "[", "args", "]"}], ">=", "2"}], "&&", 
                  RowBox[{"StringMatchQ", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"args", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"RegularExpression", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"\<\\\\s*\>\"", "<>", "var", "<>", "\"\<\\\\s*\>\""}], 
                    "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"new", "=", 
                   RowBox[{
                   "\"\<sum(\>\"", "<>", "inner", "<>", "\"\<,3)\>\""}]}], 
                  ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                  RowBox[{"s2", "=", 
                   RowBox[{"StringReplacePart", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"s2", ",", "new", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"p", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"idx", "-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Length", "[", "args", "]"}], ">=", "2"}], "&&", 
                    RowBox[{"StringMatchQ", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Last", "[", "args", "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"RegularExpression", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"\<\\\\s*\>\"", "<>", "var", "<>", "\"\<\\\\s*\>\""}], 
                    "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"inner", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"StringJoin", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"Riffle", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Most", "[", "args", "]"}], ",", "\"\<,\>\""}], 
                    "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"new", "=", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"\<sum(\>\"", "<>", "inner", "<>", "\"\<,3)\>\""}]}], 
                    ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"s2", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"StringReplacePart", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"s2", ",", "new", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"p", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"idx", "-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"posList", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"Delete", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"posList", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"Continue", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}],
               ",", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"posList", "=", 
                RowBox[{"Delete", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"posList", ",", 
                  RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
               RowBox[{"Continue", "[", "]"}], ";"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
            "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
            RowBox[{"posList", "=", 
             RowBox[{"StringPosition", "[", 
              RowBox[{"s2", ",", "\"\<Sum(\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "]"}], 
         ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "s2"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"(*", 
      RowBox[{"end", " ", "replaceSum"}], "*)"}], 
     RowBox[{"str", "=", 
      RowBox[{"replaceSum", "[", 
       RowBox[{"str", ",", "\"\<ms\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"str", "=", 
      RowBox[{"replaceSum", "[", 
       RowBox[{"str", ",", "\"\<mb\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"str", "=", 
      RowBox[{"replaceSum", "[", 
       RowBox[{"str", ",", "\"\<m\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"str", "=", 
      RowBox[{"StringReplace", "[", 
       RowBox[{"str", ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\"\<S(ms)\>\"", "->", "\"\<S\>\""}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<Sp(ms)\>\"", "->", "\"\<Sp\>\""}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<Spp(ms)\>\"", "->", "\"\<Spp\>\""}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<Bs(mb)\>\"", "->", "\"\<Bs\>\""}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<Bsp(mb)\>\"", "->", "\"\<Bsp\>\""}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<Bspp(mb)\>\"", "->", "\"\<Bspp\>\""}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<KroneckerDelta(kp,kp)\>\"", "->", "\"\<1\>\""}]}], 
         "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"StringTrim", "[", "str", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"WriteRes", "[", 
     RowBox[{"fileName_String", ",", "funcName_String"}], "]"}], ":=", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"stream", ",", "argsStr", ",", "nRes"}], "}"}], ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"argsStr", "=", 
        RowBox[{"StringRiffle", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
           "\"\<r\>\"", ",", "\"\<x\>\"", ",", "\"\<epsilon\>\"", ",", 
            "\"\<omega\>\"", ",", "\"\<kinetic_profiles\>\"", ",", 
            "\"\<q\>\"", ",", "\"\<qp\>\"", ",", "\"\<P0\>\"", ",", 
            "\"\<P1\>\"", ",", "\"\<P2\>\"", ",", "\"\<M_profiles\>\"", ",", 
            "\"\<dof_count\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Nb\>\"", ",", " ", 
            "\"\<Sbc\>\"", ",", "\"\<equation_of_state\>\""}], "}"}], ",", 
          "\"\<,\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"stream", "=", 
        RowBox[{"OpenWrite", "[", "fileName", "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"(*", "HEADER", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", 
         RowBox[{
         "\"\<function R = \>\"", "<>", "funcName", "<>", "\"\<(\>\"", "<>", 
          "argsStr", "<>", "\"\<)\\n\>\""}]}], "]"}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tN = numel(r);\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tNs = numel(Sbc);\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tnRes = 3+Nb+Ns;\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"(*", 
        RowBox[{"Unknowns", " ", "unpacking"}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tt2_c    = x(1:dof_count);\\n\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tdelta_c = x(dof_count+1:2*dof_count);\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", "\"\<\\tP_c = x(2*dof_count+1:3*dof_count);\\n\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tBs_c    = reshape(x(3*dof_count+1:(3+Nb)*dof_count), \
[dof_count, 1, Nb]);\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tBs_flat   = reshape(Bs_c, size(Bs_c,1), []);        % \
dof_count x Ns\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tS_unkn     = reshape(x((3+Nb)*dof_count+1:end), \
[dof_count-1, 1, Ns]);\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tS_c     = cat(1, S_unkn, reshape(Sbc, [1, 1, \
Ns]));\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tS_flat   = reshape(S_c, size(S_c,1), []);        % dof_count \
x Ns\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"(*", 
        RowBox[{
        "Reconstruction", " ", "at", " ", "quadrature", " ", "points"}], 
        "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tt2      = P0 * t2_c;\\n\>\""}], "]"}], 
       ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tt2p     = P1 * t2_c;\\n\>\""}], "]"}], 
       ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tdelta   = P0 * delta_c;\\n\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tdeltap  = P1 * delta_c;\\n\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tdeltapp = P2 * delta_c;\\n\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tP   = P0 * P_c;\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tPp  = P1 * P_c;\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tPpp = P2 * P_c;\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tBs       = reshape(P0 * Bs_flat, N, 1, []);\\n\\tBsp = \
reshape(P1 * Bs_flat, N, 1, []);\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tS       = reshape(P0 * S_flat, N, 1, []);\\n\\tSp = \
reshape(P1 * S_flat, N, 1, []);\\n\\tSpp = reshape(P2 * S_flat, N, 1, []);\\n\
\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tresTotal = zeros(nRes,N);\\n\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tms = reshape(linspace(2,Ns+1,Ns), [1,1,Ns]);\\n\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", "\"\<\\tmb = reshape(0:(Nb-1), [1,1,Nb]);\\n\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"(*", "Residuals", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<\\tresF = \>\"", "<>", 
          RowBox[{"ToMatlab", "[", "resF", "]"}], "<>", "\"\<;\\n\>\""}]}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<\\tresB = \>\"", "<>", 
          RowBox[{"ToMatlab", "[", "resBB", "]"}], "<>", "\"\<;\\n\>\""}]}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tresF_FFT = real(fft(resF, [], 2))/numel(omega);\\n\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tresB_FFT = real(fft(resB, [], 2))/numel(omega);\\n\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tmF = [0, 1, 2:(Ns+1)];\\n\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\trowsF = [1, 2, (2 + Nb + (2:(Ns+1)))];\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";",
        "\n", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tmB = 0:(Nb-1);\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", 
       "\n", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\trowsB = 3 + (1:Nb);\\n\>\""}], "]"}], 
       ";", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tresTotal(rowsF, :) = resF_FFT(:, mF + 1).';\\n\>\""}], "]"}],
        ";", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tresTotal(rowsB, :) = resB_FFT(:, mB + 1).';\\n\>\""}], "]"}],
        ";", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<\\tresTotal(3,:) = mean(\>\"", "<>", 
          RowBox[{"ToMatlab", "[", "resP", "]"}], "<>", 
          "\"\<, 2);\\n\>\""}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "stream", ",", 
         "\"\<\\tR = M_profiles * reshape(resTotal.', [], 1);\\n\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<end\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"Close", "[", "stream", "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<Wrote MATLAB file \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]\>\"", ",", "fileName", 
         ",", "\"\<\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] with <\>\"", ",", "funcName", 
         ",", "\"\<>.\>\""}], "]"}], ";"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"WriteJac", "[", 
    RowBox[{"fileName_String", ",", "funcName_String", ",", "jacExpr_"}], 
    "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"stream", ",", "argsStr", ",", "dimsJac"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"argsStr", "=", 
       RowBox[{"StringRiffle", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
          "\"\<r\>\"", ",", "\"\<x\>\"", ",", "\"\<epsilon\>\"", ",", 
           "\"\<omega\>\"", ",", "\"\<kinetic_profiles\>\"", ",", "\"\<q\>\"",
            ",", "\"\<qp\>\"", ",", "\"\<P0\>\"", ",", "\"\<P1\>\"", ",", 
           "\"\<P2\>\"", ",", "\"\<dof_count\>\"", ",", "\"\<Nb\>\"", ",", 
           "\"\<Sbc\>\"", ",", "\"\<P_templates\>\"", ",", 
           "\"\<M_extended\>\"", ",", "\"\<equation_of_state\>\""}], "}"}], 
         ",", "\"\<,\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"dimsJac", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Dimensions", "[", "jacExpr", "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"stream", "=", 
       RowBox[{"OpenWrite", "[", "fileName", "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
       RowBox[{"stream", ",", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<function J = \>\"", "<>", "funcName", "<>", "\"\<(\>\"", "<>", 
         "argsStr", "<>", "\"\<)\\n\>\""}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
       RowBox[{
       "stream", ",", 
        "\"\<\\tNq = numel(r);\n\\tNs = numel(Sbc);\n\\tnRes = 3+Nb+Ns;\n\
\\tt2_c    = x(1:dof_count);\n\\tdelta_c = x(dof_count+1:2*dof_count);\n\
\\tP_c = x(2*dof_count+1:3*dof_count);\n\\tBs_c    = \
reshape(x(3*dof_count+1:(3+Nb)*dof_count), [dof_count, 1, Nb]);\n\\tBs_flat   \
= reshape(Bs_c, size(Bs_c,1), []);        % dof_count x Ns\n\\tS_unkn     = \
reshape(x((3+Nb)*dof_count+1:end), [dof_count-1, 1, Ns]);\n\\tS_c     = \
cat(1, S_unkn, reshape(Sbc, [1, 1, Ns]));\n\\tS_flat   = reshape(S_c, \
size(S_c,1), []);        % dof_count x Ns\n\\tt2      = P0 * t2_c;\n\\tt2p    \
 = P1 * t2_c;\n\\tdelta   = P0 * delta_c;\n\\tdeltap  = P1 * delta_c;\n\
\\tdeltapp = P2 * delta_c;\n\\tP   = P0 * P_c;\n\\tPp  = P1 * P_c;\n\\tPpp = \
P2 * P_c;\n\\tBs       = reshape(P0 * Bs_flat, Nq, 1, []);\n\\tBsp = \
reshape(P1 * Bs_flat, Nq, 1, []);\n\\tS       = reshape(P0 * S_flat, Nq, 1, \
[]);\n\\tSp = reshape(P1 * S_flat, Nq, 1, []);\n\\tSpp = reshape(P2 * S_flat, \
Nq, 1, []);\n\\tms = reshape(linspace(2,Ns+1,Ns), [1,1,Ns]);\n\\tmb = \
reshape(0:(Nb-1), [1,1,Nb]);\n    Ntheta = numel(omega);\n    mF   = \
[0,1,2:(Ns+1)];\n    rowsF = [1,2,(2 + Nb + (2:(Ns+1)))];\n    mB   = \
0:(Nb-1);\n    rowsB = 3 + (1:Nb); \n    nmF = numel(mF);\n    nmB = \
numel(mB);\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"(*", 
       RowBox[{"jacTotal", " ", "prealloc"}], "*)"}], 
      RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
       RowBox[{
       "stream", ",", 
        "\"\<\\tjacTotal = zeros(3,nRes,nRes,Nq); % (which deriv, which \
equation, which profile)\\n\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"(*", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"--", 
          RowBox[{"-", "resF"}]}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"modes", "--"}]}], "-"}], "*)"}], 
      RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
       RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\t% --- resF modes ---\\n\>\""}], "]"}], 
      ";", "\n", 
      RowBox[{"(*", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"scalar", " ", "3", "x3", " ", "blocks"}], "->", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"j11F", "..."}], " ", "j33F"}]}], "*)"}], 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"If", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"jacExpr", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", 
                 RowBox[{"d", ",", "j", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], "=!=", 
               "0"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
                RowBox[{"stream", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<\\t\>\"", "<>", "\"\<j\>\"", "<>", 
                  RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "d", "]"}], "<>", 
                  RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "j", "]"}], "<>", "\"\<F = \>\"", "<>", 
                  RowBox[{"ToMatlab", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"jacExpr", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"d", ",", "j", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                  "<>", "\"\<;\\n\>\""}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
               RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
                RowBox[{"stream", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<\\t\>\"", "<>", "\"\<j\>\"", "<>", 
                  RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "d", "]"}], "<>", 
                  RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "j", "]"}], "<>", 
                  "\"\<F_FFT = real(fft(\>\"", "<>", "\"\<j\>\"", "<>", 
                  RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "d", "]"}], "<>", 
                  RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "j", "]"}], "<>", 
                  "\"\<F, [], 2)) / Ntheta;\\n\>\""}]}], "]"}], ";", 
               "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
               RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
                RowBox[{"stream", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<\\t\>\"", "<>", "\"\<jacTotal(\>\"", "<>", 
                  RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "d", "]"}], "<>", "\"\<,\>\"", "<>", 
                  RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "j", "]"}], "<>", 
                  "\"\<, rowsF, :) = reshape(\>\"", "<>", "\"\<j\>\"", "<>", 
                  RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "d", "]"}], "<>", 
                  RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "j", "]"}], "<>", 
                  "\"\<F_FFT(:, mF+1).',\>\"", "<>", 
                  "\"\< [1,1,nmF, Nq]);\\n\\n\>\""}]}], "]"}], ";"}]}], "]"}],
             ";"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"j", ",", "1", ",", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"d", ",", "1", ",", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\n", 
      RowBox[{"(*", 
       RowBox[{"derivatives", " ", "wrt", " ", "B_l", " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", "bundle", ")"}]}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
       RowBox[{
       "stream", ",", "\"\<\\t% derivatives wrt B_l (bundle)\\n\>\""}], "]"}],
       ";", "\n", 
      RowBox[{"WriteString", "[", 
       RowBox[{"stream", ",", "\"\<\\tfor lp = 0:Nb-1\\n\>\""}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\n", 
      RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
